               END-SEARCH.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       DERIVE-MAKE-0200.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       AUDIT-ROOF-TYPE-0201.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
